name: sim.abgToYpr
description: Converts CoppeliaSim's alpha-beta-gamma angles to Yaw-Pitch-Roll angles
luaSynopsis: list anglesOut = sim.abgToYpr(list anglesIn)
pythonSynopsis: float[3] anglesOut = sim.abgToYpr(float[3] anglesIn)
inputs:
1. anglesIn: 3 angles: alpha, beta and gamma
outputs:
1. anglesOut: 3 angles: yaw, pitch and roll
replacedBy:
- use simEigen methods
